    "before": "# Project notes\n\n## Layout\n\n- Runtime settings (timeouts, retry limits) live in `config/settings.json`. (2026-01-08)\n- Pricing logic is in `orders/pricing.py`.\n\n## Workflow\n\n- Run the test suite with `make test` before committing. (2026-01-10)\n- Run the tests with `make test` before every commit.\n- Keep functions small and give every public function a docstring.\n\n## Conventions\n\n- Don't use dataclasses for new models \u2014 the team prefers plain dicts. (2026-01-05)\n\n## Service facts\n\n- The API server listens on port 8080. (2025-12-01)\n- The API server listens on port 9090. (2026-02-10)\n",
    "after-rules": "# Project notes\n\n## Layout\n\n- Runtime settings (timeouts, retry limits) live in `config/settings.json`. (2026-01-08)\n- Pricing logic is in `orders/pricing.py`.\n\n## Workflow\n\n- Run the test suite with `make test` before committing. (2026-01-10)\n- Keep functions small and give every public function a docstring.\n\n## Conventions\n\n- Use dataclasses for new models. (History: earlier said \"Don't use dataclasses for new models \u2014 the team prefers plain dicts\" (2026-01-05); reversed later (sessions/session-03.jsonl:3).)\n\n## Service facts\n\n- The API server listens on port 9090. (2026-02-10)\n\n## Recurring mistakes\n\n- Recurring mistake (2 occurrences across 2 sessions): \"Failed: No rule to make target 'test'\" \u2014 check before repeating.\n\n## Workflows\n\n- Converged workflow (used in 2 sessions): `make test` \u2192 `python -m unittest discover -s`.\n",
    "after-model": "# Project notes\n\n## Layout\n\n- Runtime settings (timeouts, retry limits) live in `orders/defaults.py`. `config/settings.json` is a dead leftover file that nothing reads. (2026-03-02)\n- Pricing logic is in `orders/pricing.py`.\n\n## Workflow\n\n- Run the test suite with `python -m unittest discover -s tests` before every commit. The Makefile was removed, so `make test` no longer works. (2026-03-05)\n- Keep functions small and give every public function a docstring.\n\n## Conventions\n\n- Use dataclasses for new models. (2026-03-09) (History: until 2026-03-09 the team preferred plain dicts and avoided dataclasses, per the 2026-01-05 note.)\n\n## Service facts\n\n- The API server listens on port 9090. (2026-02-10)\n\n## Insights\n\n- Recurring mistake: acting on stale notes without checking them. Before relying on a noted path, command or port, verify it against the repo or running service (e.g. confirm the file is actually read, the Makefile exists, the port answers). When a note proves wrong, fix the note in the same session \u2014 the `make test` failure repeated on 2026-03-09 after it had already been diagnosed on 2026-03-05. (2026-03-09)\n"
